# SINTEL ERP Architecture Rules v2.62.0

These rules are STRICT, IMMUTABLE, and MANDATORY. Apply before any code suggestion.
Full reference: `AGENTS.md` at project root.

## ZERO TOLERANCE

| Rule | Why |
|---|---|
| No emojis in `.py` | SyntaxError → Django 500 |
| No `models.Model` inheritance | Must use `SintelTenantBaseModel` |
| No `.all()` or unguarded `.filter()` | Zero Waste ORM contract |
| No ORM without `empresa_id` | Multi-tenant data isolation |
| No Django Signals for logic | Explicit Service Layer only |
| No `from apps.public.*` in tenant apps | Cross-schema isolation |
| No direct `AsientoContable.objects.create()` | Always via Contabilizador |
| No modifying `apps/public/` | Requires RFC + admin approval |
| No FK to `AUTH_USER_MODEL` | Use `'perfil.TenantProfile'` |

## SERVICE LAYER STRUCTURE

```python
# apps/tenant/<app>/services/
crud_service.py      # @transaction.atomic — pure DB writes ONLY
business_service.py  # Business logic + Double Semantic Verification (IDOR)
selectors.py         # .only() QuerySets — LIST_FIELDS, DETAIL_FIELDS tuples
api_mixins.py        # <Model>ServiceMixin → injected into ViewSet
services.py          # Stable facade re-exporting business_service
```

## CORRECT PATTERNS

```python
# Model
from apps.tenant.core.models import SintelTenantBaseModel
class MyModel(SintelTenantBaseModel): ...  # empresa + timestamps auto-injected

# QuerySet
MyModel.objects.filter(empresa_id=empresa_id).only('id', 'uuid', 'nombre')

# ViewSet
class MyViewSet(MyModelServiceMixin, BaseTenantViewSet):
    permission_classes = [IsTenantMember, IsTenantAdminOrReadOnly]
    lookup_field = "uuid"
    queryset = MyModel.objects.none()

# Accounting
from apps.tenant.contabilidad.services.asientos_service import materializar_asiento_desde_gasto
asiento = materializar_asiento_desde_gasto(gasto)  # never create AsientoContable directly

# Cross-schema
from apps.tenant.core.services.membership import check_membership  # bridge ONLY

# JWT (frontend)
const token = window.jwtAuth?.getAccessToken?.();  # never .token
```

## TEMPLATE PATHS
- Tenant: `apps/tenant/<app>/templates/tenant/<app>/` ← `tenant/` prefix MANDATORY
- Public: `apps/public/<app>/templates/<app>/`

## ACCOUNTING DTOs
```python
LineaTransaccion(concepto='GASTO_OPERATIVO', monto=Decimal('1000000'), lado='DEBE')
ImpuestoLinea(tipo='RETEFUENTE', valor=Decimal('40000'), lado='HABER')
# DEBE total == HABER total (cuadratura) — always balanced
```

## PERMISSIONS
```python
# Import ONLY from this module:
from apps.tenant.api.permissions import IsTenantMember, IsTenantAdminOrReadOnly
# NEVER from: apps.tenant.empresa.permissions (deprecated)
```
